<title>GREECE: TABLE-GREEK/BUND GAP STABLE AT 404 BPS, 310 VS BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GREEK/BUND GAP STABLE AT 404 BPS, 310 VS BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year</p>
<p>bond over bunds was unchanged from Friday at 404 basis points.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap was also flat at 310 basis points.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>								   </p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.60%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.56%	404	404 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.43%	417	418 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.50%	310	310 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.27%	333	334 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    5.86%	374	342 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.14%	246	247 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.34%	326	328 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0926</p>
<p>GMT.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
